<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Terms of service' }) %>
<body>
  <main class="container py-5" style="max-width:44rem">
    <div class="mb-4"><%- include('partials/brand') %></div>
    <h1 class="h3 mb-4">Terms of service</h1>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-body d-grid gap-3">
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Last updated: November 2026. This is a starter template — replace it with your own terms before going to production.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">1. The service</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">This service provides centralized authentication and account management. By creating an account you agree to use it lawfully and not to abuse, probe or disrupt the service.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">2. Your account</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">You are responsible for keeping your credentials confidential and for activity under your account. You must provide a valid email address.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">3. Third-party applications</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">When you authorize an application, you decide which information it can access. You can revoke that access at any time from your account page.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">4. Termination</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">You may delete your account at any time. We may suspend accounts that violate these terms.</p>
    </div></div>
    <p class="form-text mt-4"><a href="/signup">Back to sign up</a></p>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
